          "alt_text": "Expired identity and safe retry are separate checks. Expired session; Renew through approved provider; New access key + secret key + token; Inspect original operation outcome; Known completed: do not repeat merely due to expiry; Retry warranted: supported idempotency token where available",
          "lineage": {
